seg-76db63e8d2de = Buyers and receiver makers answer to public resilience frameworks. This folder maps what Kshana computes and records to those frameworks, row by row, and <c1/> fills the mapping from the runs you actually have.

# text
seg-e22a3aca9550 = <b>Wording.</b> Kshana outputs <em>support evidence for</em> a requirement. They are not a rating or approval of any product, and none of these files is a statement from an assessment body; Kshana is not one. Requirement text is paraphrased, never reproduced.

