# c1: jamming
# c2: integrity
# c3: src/compliance/mapping.rs
# c4: KIND_FIELDS
seg-464351dcdcc3 = <b>A kind label alone is not evidence.</b> A run counts for a capability only when its result also carries the fields that kind writes (for example a <c1/> result needs its figures of merit and per-epoch rows; an <c2/> result needs its sample counts). The fields are listed in <c3/> (<c4/>) and a result missing one is not counted. A hash that is not hexadecimal is not reported as a hash. A receiver-trust result whose counts are not whole numbers, or whose detected or agreeing count exceeds its evaluable count, is excluded and listed as not used.

